## Step 5: Set Up the Triggers

In Apps Script, go to **Triggers** (clock icon) and add:

| Function | Trigger Type | Frequency |
|---|---|---|
| updateOverdueStatus | Time-driven | Daily, 8:00am |
| sendReminders | Time-driven | Daily, 9:00am |

